      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the largest buyers and suppliers in Massachusetts now?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs is the largest buyer in FY2027 to date with $115M, followed by the Department of the Treasury with $36.6M and the Department of Transportation with $31M. CRANE & CO., INC. is the largest vendor in FY2027 to date with $36M, followed by RAYTHEON COMPANY with $14.5M and PROGENICS PHARMACEUTICALS INC with $12.8M. Paper Mills is the top industry by obligations in FY2027 to date with $34M."
